# commented_header.obj -- a one-quad model whose FIRST 300+ BYTES ARE COMMENTS.
# It exists for document.characterisation (smoke L10 item 4). The default
# ground plane of a new scene stopped loading on 2026-09-11 when a note like
# this one was added at the top of its file: assimp picks an importer for a
# file read from MEMORY (every Qt resource path) by sniffing only the leading
# two hundred bytes for a format keyword, and a long enough comment block
# pushes every keyword past that window. The model then failed with nothing
# but an unhelpful parse error in the log.
#
# IrisGL now hands the importer the extension of the resource, which is how a
# file read from disk has always been dispatched, so the comment block no
# longer matters. Keep this block long and keep its words plain.
mtllib none.mtl
v -1.0 0.0 1.0
v 1.0 0.0 1.0
v 1.0 0.0 -1.0
v -1.0 0.0 -1.0
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
f 1//1 2//1 3//1
f 1//1 3//1 4//1
